# 29_noise_sleep_pulsed_RGB.ledc — AM-Noise Sleep Bed (pulsed/trapezoid), RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 29_noise_sleep_pulsed. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (0.85 Hz trapezoid-gated
# pink bed, 40% duty / 50 ms attack, + steady brown warmth). The light is STEADY (freq 0),
# dim warm amber: inner ring amber (mask 9, 255,160,32) + outer ring deep red (mask 6,
# 255,24,16). Steady red is safe. Brightness <=12%; ends dark + silent. See base header.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask   (freq 0 = STEADY)

# --- Settle: dim amber steady light + noise fade-in ---
0 0 100 >0 255 160 32 9                  # inner amber: steady, bright fade-in
0 0 100 >0 255 24 16 6                   # outer deep-red: steady halo
A 0 200 0 >0 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50        # ch1 pink noise, 0.85 Hz trapezoid gate (40% duty, 50 ms attack); vol fade-in
A 0 100 0 >0 0 2 0 6                     # ch2 brown noise, steady warm bed; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 10 "Settling in. Let the slow waves of sound rock you toward sleep."
15000 0 100 12 255 160 32 9              # inner: 12% (dim)
15000 0 100 12 255 24 16 6               # outer
A 60000 200 0 90 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50    # ch1 pink vol settled (trapezoid held)
A 60000 100 0 60 0 2 0 6                 # ch2 brown vol settled

# --- Hold: steady dim light + pulsed pink bed + brown warmth ---
S 600000 default 10 "Each soft pulse a little deeper. Nothing to hold. Just drift."

# --- Soft Off: brightness + both noise beds fade to 0 (no wake-up) ---
1680000 0 100 >12 255 160 32 9           # inner: brightness ramp-out
1680000 0 100 >12 255 24 16 6            # outer
A 1680000 200 0 *90 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50 # ch1 pink quad fade (trapezoid held)
A 1680000 100 0 *60 0 2 0 6              # ch2 brown quad fade
S 1680000 default 10 "The pulses are fading now. Let go completely. Sleep."
1800000 0 100 0 255 160 32 9             # inner off (dark)
1800000 0 100 0 255 24 16 6              # outer off
A 1800000 200 0 0 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50   # pink 0
A 1800000 100 0 0 0 2 0 6                # brown 0 (silent)
